ds": ["cd662ee340e547fe8763"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 104576495, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 233438599, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Workspace", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Workspace", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "65b7d357a0a148b49bef", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 207.1, "width": 504.5, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cd662ee340e547fe8763"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1371392919, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2016683062, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Setiap akun punya workspace Personal (organisasi pribadi, lib/personalOrgs)\nplus nol atau lebih organisasi tim; pemilih workspace di UI (WorkspaceContext)\nKonten tanpa org = Personal (org_id null)\nKunci API, model, konektor, CourtListener, memory: PER workspace\nOrg tidak pernah mengambil alih workspace Personal siapa pun", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Setiap akun punya workspace Personal (organisasi pribadi, lib/personalOrgs)\nplus nol atau lebih organisasi tim; pemilih workspace di UI (WorkspaceContext)\nKonten tanpa org = Personal (org_id null)\nKunci API, model, konektor, CourtListener, memory: PER workspace\nOrg tidak pernah mengambil alih workspace Personal siapa pun", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "6500b7de8fd7481cac0e", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 140, "width": 730, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["455445d0c0e2455286a3"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 841467880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2120527458, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "2ce3e0b4c4ad448aa7d0", "type": "text", "x": 844, "y": 175.4, "width": 163.2, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["455445d0c0e2455286a3"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1407888615, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1283720513, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Peran & undangan", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Peran & undangan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "5a8cbd2c0c7147749d93", "type": "text", "x": 844, "y": 207.1, "width": 552.8, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["455445d0c0e2455286a3"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507116860, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1348522947, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Peran org: owner · admin · member (org_members)\nUndangan via email (org_invitations); terima saat onboarding (layar ke-3)\n  atau Settings › Organizations; detail undangan tak dicari dari email belum terverifikasi\nPemilik terakhir tak bisa pergi tanpa menunjuk pemilik lain / hapus org\nAdmin: keluarkan anggota biasa & alihkan konten bersama; bukan owner/admin", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Peran org: owner · admin · member (org_members)\nUndangan via email (org_invitations); terima saat onboarding (layar ke-3)\n  atau Settings › Organizations; detail undangan tak dicari dari email belum terverifikasi\nPemilik terakhir tak bisa pergi tanpa menunjuk pemilik lain / hapus org\nAdmin: keluarkan anggota biasa & alihkan konten bersama; bukan owner/admin", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "33c619d45e7d490fbfd5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1600, "y": 140, "width": 730, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5cd2c3f6787343389148"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1430467144, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 237311612, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "2afdad3e2b194c08993f", "type": "text", "x": 1614, "y": 157.9, "width": 122.9, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5cd2c3f6787343389148"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1123084754, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1398580666, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Privasi konten", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Privasi konten", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "7b6568d28ed64bd09dc9", "type": "text", "x": 1614, "y": 189.6, "width": 463.6, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5cd2c3f6787343389148"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 230128086, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 117240075, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Proyek/workflow/chat/review standalone di org: PRIVAT default\nDibagikan ke anggota tertentu (override Owner/Editor/Viewer/Deny) atau\n  publik → anggota jadi Editor · tak pernah keluar dari org\nChat standalone di org = milik org tapi privat bagi pembuatnya\nKonten privat org: owner, atau admin yang diberi izin owner\n  (can_access_private_content), membuka per item sebagai Viewer;\n  tercatat di org_private_content_access + audit_events", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Proyek/workflow/chat/review standalone di org: PRIVAT default\nDibagikan ke anggota tertentu (override Owner/Editor/Viewer/Deny) atau\n  publik → anggota jadi Editor · tak pernah keluar dari org\nChat standalone di org = milik org tapi privat bagi pembuatnya\nKonten privat org: owner, atau admin yang diberi izin owner\n  (can_access_private_content), membuka per item sebagai Viewer;\n  tercatat di org_private_content_access + audit_events", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "bd2095435b1144b883c8", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 420, "width": 1130, "height": 230, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b7dbbe9fc73846bb8193"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 867744124, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1082112628, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a3d52318584948559435", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 457.9, "width": 495.7, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b7dbbe9fc73846bb8193"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 96320154, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1002125134, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Aturan offboarding (hapus anggota / keluar / hapus akun)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Aturan offboarding (hapus anggota / keluar / hapus akun)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "7f0930ed1ae54c57ba75", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 489.6, "width": 644.9, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b7dbbe9fc73846bb8193"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1985449731, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20070611, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Item masih punya owner lain → tetap, owner lama tetap.\nPublik/dibagikan tanpa owner lain → pindah ke satu anggota terpilih\n  (default: owner org yang tersisa).\nPrivat & tak dibagikan, tanpa owner lain → ARSIP 30 hari lalu hapus permanen.\nBerlaku untuk: proyek, workflow, chat standalone, review tabular, dokumen library.\nIsi proyek/workflow mengikuti induknya; file library yang dirujuk tetap dipertahankan.\nremove_org_member (kunci org) + trigger keanggotaan: pindah/arsip + cabut grant — satu transaksi.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Item masih punya owner lain → tetap, owner lama tetap.\nPublik/dibagikan tanpa owner lain → pindah ke satu anggota terpilih\n  (default: owner org yang tersisa).\nPrivat & tak dibagikan, tanpa owner lain → ARSIP 30 hari lalu hapus permanen.\nBerlaku untuk: proyek, workflow, chat standalone, review tabular, dokumen library.\nIsi proyek/workflow mengikuti induknya; file library yang dirujuk tetap dipertahankan.\nremove_org_member (kunci org) + trigger keanggotaan: pindah/arsip + cabut grant — satu transaksi.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "22c88adfee144adf867b", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1230, "y": 420, "width": 1130, "height": 230, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["718288e068f74916bf88"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1507626677, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1827288921, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "94ed08d3206d42249e37", "type": "text", "x": 1244, "y": 466.6, "width": 274.1, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["718288e068f74916bf88"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 984153306, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 831466172, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Arsip, penghapusan org & akun", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Arsip, penghapusan org & akun", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e3101183ee184ef7b44a", "type": "text", "x": 1244, "y": 498.4, "width": 588.1, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["718288e068f74916bf88"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 698365449, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1957206819, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Hanya owner org: lihat/alihkan/hapus arsip (Organization settings › Members › Departed).\nKonten arsip tak dapat diakses siapa pun (termasuk owner) sebelum dialihkan.\nKonektor yang ditambahkan anggota untuk org dihapus (beserta kredensial) saat ia keluar.\nrequest_account_deletion: offboarding SEMUA org + job account.delete + tandai akun;\n  autentikasi menolak akses (401 account_deletion_pending).\nOrg: soft_delete_organization → restore_organization → purge_expired_organizations (job).", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Hanya owner org: lihat/alihkan/hapus arsip (Organization settings › Members › Departed).\nKonten arsip tak dapat diakses siapa pun (termasuk owner) sebelum dialihkan.\nKonektor yang ditambahkan anggota untuk org dihapus (beserta kredensial) saat ia keluar.\nrequest_account_deletion: offboarding SEMUA org + job account.delete + tandai akun;\n  autentikasi menolak akses (401 account_deletion_pending).\nOrg: soft_delete_organization → restore_organization → purge_expired_organizations (job).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "b5be87c2ed1c4cfb8e79", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 730, "width": 2340, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["6b5484a1b31c405f8dd0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 262429714, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 124921527, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176082, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "d281dc9fa0074b37822f", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 764.8, "width": 207.7, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["6b5484a1b31c405f8dd0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1481794649, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1836619166, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 17934